    "name": {
      "zh": "Commodore PET 2001",
      "en": "Commodore PET 2001"
    },
    "intro": {
      "zh": "Commodore PET 2001 是 1977 年 Commodore 推出的一体式个人电脑，与 Apple II、TRS-80 并称 1977 三杰，内置 BASIC 与磁带机，开箱即用。",
      "en": "The Commodore PET 2001, launched in 1977, was one of the 1977 Trinity of personal computers, an all-in-one machine with built-in BASIC and cassette drive."
    },
    "spec_version": "0.2",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "engine_min_version": "0.1.0",
    "precision_level": "L2",
    "era": 1977,
    "manufacturer": "Commodore",
    "category": "personal-computer",
    "description": "Commodore PET 2001（1977），1977 三杰之一：6502 CPU 1MHz、4KB 内存、内置 9 英寸单显、chiclet 小键盘、内置磁带机、一体成型机壳。",
    "authors": [
